### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### ORDER SERVICE — History & Details
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

@host = http://localhost:18000
@access_token = {{access_token}}

### ── 1. List my orders ──────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{host}}/api/customer/orders?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### ── 2. Get order detail ────────────────────────────────────────
GET {{host}}/api/customer/orders/{{order_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### ── 3. Cancel order ────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{host}}/api/customer/orders/{{order_id}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
